# Staging scratch (estate-local on the primary clone; task scratch in each worktree). Contents never ship. See .staging/README.md.
.staging/*
!.staging/README.md

# Third-party archives are inert feedstock; only the README ships. See third_party/README.md.
third_party/**
!third_party/README.md

# Terraform working data is disposable and never committed.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
